=== oxf(13)

Solving x ^ 4 - 6 * x ^ 3 - 7 * x ^ 2 + 36 * x + 36 = 0 for x

Tidying to 36 * x + -6 * x ^ 3 + -7 * x ^ 2 + x ^ 4 = -36

